    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d100">

                <pb facs="0135" n="129" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg129"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 64.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Commissioner of the United States to China</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1901-04-15"><hi rendition="#italic">April 15,
                                1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith for
                    your information copy of a report made by the British special-service officer
                    detailed to investigate the looting of the foreign settlement at Peitaiho in
                    June last, in which is set forth the punishments meeted out to those persons
                    found guilty of participation in said act.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d100-a1.xml" xpointer="d100-a1"/>
